Chencho (Upset): Dude, I think you sent me the wrong way. This path is lookin kinda weird.
Chud (Eyebrow): Didn’t you go left?
Chencho (Upset): Uh no, I went right like you told me to.
Chud (Angry): Bro, I said right as in 'you’re correct'. Go left.
Chencho (Tired): Oh.
Chud (Eyebrow): Just turn around.
do StateManager.startPersistentStateCheck("turnedAround")
Chencho (Tired): Uh… doesn’t seem like I can.
Chud (Worried): It’s fine, there’s another intersection up ahead.
do StateManager.updateState("trail1GoRight")